@startuml Sequence: Добавление узла
actor User
participant MainWindow
participant CircuitScene
participant AppController
participant CommandFactory
participant AddNodeCommand
participant Circuit

User -> MainWindow : Выбор инструмента + клик по сцене
MainWindow -> CircuitScene : mousePressEvent()
CircuitScene -> AppController : add_node(type, x, y)
AppController -> CommandFactory : create_add_node()
CommandFactory -> AddNodeCommand ** : create
AppController -> CommandHistory : execute(cmd)
CommandHistory -> AddNodeCommand : execute()
AddNodeCommand -> Circuit : add_node()
Circuit --> AddNodeCommand : node_id
CommandHistory --> AppController
AppController --> CircuitScene : return
CircuitScene -> CircuitScene : sync_scene()
CircuitScene --> MainWindow
@enduml